{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04358","headline":"江南曲八首 六 · 刘希夷","name":"江南曲八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春三月晴，维扬吴楚城。\n城临大江汜，回映洞浦清。\n晴云曲金阁，珠楼碧烟里。\n月明芳树羣鸟飞，风过长林杂花起。\n可怜离别谁家子，於此一至情何已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}